ood to survive."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"frame","value":"2","raw":"边框"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Are you sure it's enough...?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"frame","value":"2","raw":"边框"},{"type":"shake","value":"%%type_id=2%%duration=4%%delay=0.1%%range=5","raw":"controll_shake"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Combat_Hits","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander looks at the Dolls locked in a free-for-all."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"frame","value":"2","raw":"边框"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"For both humans and Dolls, food is more than just filling up the belly."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"frame","value":"2","raw":"边框"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"2021summer_Street","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"closeMask","raw":"关闭蒙版"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If the Commander was like a lifeless, droopy tree by the road in fall when they first met No. 390, then they are now an ice cream under the blazing sun."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"No. 390 has utterly no idea what their problem is."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-HK433","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,130"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"No. 390","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander, if you're not hungry, let's move on to the next attraction."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
